{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "030c8104-9a5b-8416-94ab-244ec67c13be",
  "created_at": "2026-02-27T12:25:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lidia Pina",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:21:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:21:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I am calling about a ticket. A parking ticket. I got it this morning, on my car, and it is, um, it is wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What does the ticket say it's for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:21:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It says the registration sticker is expired. But I renewed it yesterday. Yesterday! I have the paper from the registry in my, my bag. The new sticker is, is on the plate. Maybe the man did not look close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:21:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, the timing sting. Renewed one day, ticketed the next. Do you have the ticket number in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:21:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one moment. [pause] It is a long number. Starts with the letters P, K, and then four, four, zero, seven, one, eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:21:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P K four four zero seven one eight. Got it. Let me pull that up. [pause] Okay, I see it. Issued this morning, expired registration. Did you put the sticker on the plate before you parked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:22:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I put it on, yes, last night. Right away. I am not a person who waits. I have the business, I have a lot of things to do, I do not need this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:22:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. You can contest it, and the first thing they'll want is proof of the renewal date. Your registry paper should do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:22:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the officer, he took a photo, no? They take the photo of the car. I want to see it. Can you send it to me by email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:22:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If there's a photo attached to the record, I can have it sent. What's the email address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:22:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, um... lidia, L-I-D-I-A, and then pina, P-I-N-A, parking, at, hmm, how do you say, at example dot com."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:22:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read it back. Lidia, Pina, parking, at example dot com. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request. It may take a day or two to come through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:23:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Now, another thing. If I decide to just pay it, to finish with this. I work all day. I am at my shop until after five. Can I pay in person after four-thirty? Or in the evening, maybe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:23:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall's counter closes at four-thirty, so not in person after that. But there's a drop box outside for payments, and you can pay online any hour, even midnight, if you like paying tickets in your pajamas."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:23:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha. No pajamas. But online is okay. The drop box, where is it? At City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:23:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, at City Hall, on the Broadway side. Check or money order in an envelope with the ticket number on it. Not cash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Broadway side. Okay. And the address is, what is the number? I write it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One twenty-five Broadway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One, five, two Broadway. Okay, I have it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, one two five. One, two, five. Not one fifty-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. One, two, five. I wrote it wrong. Let me fix. [pause] One two five. Okay, good, now it is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And if you contest it, you may not need to pay at all, so I'd hold off until you hear back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will wait. I do not want to pay for something I did not do wrong. It is, honestly, a little ridiculous."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Keep that registry paper handy and watch your email for the photo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Pina. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:24:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
